        <footnote id="F1">The Reporting Person was awarded 26,531 shares of restricted stock, which vest in equal quarterly installments on the end of each quarter beginning on March 31, 2026 through December 31, 2026, contingent upon continued service as a member of the board of directors of Great Elm Group, Inc. (&quot;GEG&quot;).</footnote>
